# #521: gated gate/up products (SwiGLU / GeGLU: n = gate rows, the file lists the pair as the tuner
# times it, 2n rows) of the models of the issue, Q4_K_M (gate/up are Q4_K), and the same n x k as a
# plain store, whose time twice is an estimate of the "two non-gated launches" alternative (each
# single call carries its own activation quantisation; see the header of run_521_gateup.sh).
# The summary expects every swiglu line at every point, and a store line of the same n x k for its
# twin.
# Qwen3-8B and Qwen3.5-9B: hidden 4096, intermediate 12288.
# Gemma 4 12B: hidden 3840, intermediate 15360.
q4k a16 swiglu 12288 4096
q4k a16 store 12288 4096
q4k a16 swiglu 15360 3840
q4k a16 store 15360 3840
